# The lobby service is a Go module. Go tooling (gofmt, go test) expects LF.
# Git for Windows checks out with CRLF by default, which makes gofmt report
# every file as unformatted. Pin these to LF so the checks are deterministic
# on every platform.
*.go    text eol=lf
go.mod  text eol=lf
go.sum  text eol=lf
*.conf  text eol=lf
